    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2220" root="برد" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرِدٌ</span></b>  <i>Possessing coldness</i> or <i>coolness:</i> an epithet
applied to the [plant called] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِلِّيَان</span>. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحَابٌ بَرِدٌ</span>, (T, S, M, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْرَدُ</span></b> , (S, K,)
<i>Clouds containing hail</i> (T, S, M, K *) <i>and cold.</i>
(T.) You say also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحَابَةٌ بَرِدَةٌ</span> <i>A cloud containing
hail</i> (T, S, M, A *) <i>and cold;</i> (T;) but not <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سحابة</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرْدَآءُ</span>. (M.)

